# tof_silent_takeoff_noise.expect — ToF silent early in the auto-takeoff climb, sensor noise n2, estimate 17 % too high
# 自動離陸の上昇の初期に ToF が出力停止、センサノイズ n2、見積もり 17 % 高い
#
# Chain: as tof_silent_takeoff_est_high.expect, with sensor noise n2 (seed 1) and hover.thrust_corr 1.1. With
# this noise the climb reaches its target (TAKEOFF -> FLYING) just before the silence is judged, so the
# landing starts from FLYING/POS_HOLD, still climbing at 1.7 m/s (truth).
# 連鎖: tof_silent_takeoff_est_high.expect と同じ。センサノイズ n2（seed 1）、hover.thrust_corr 1.1。このノイズでは
# 出力停止が判定される直前に上昇が目標に達し（TAKEOFF -> FLYING）、着陸は FLYING/POS_HOLD から始まる。
# その時点でも 1.7 m/s（真値）で上昇中。
exit 0
log_contains any "ARM accepted"
log_contains any "Transition: ARMED_GROUND → TAKEOFF"
log_contains any "Downward ToF silent (>= 300 ms without a sample) in FLYING/POS_HOLD → LANDING"
log_contains any "Blind landing: ToF silent, velocity loop"
log_contains any "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
log_contains any "ARM rejected: downward ToF is silent"
log_contains any "Transition: TAKEOFF → FLYING"
log_absent any "touchdown by time"
order "Transition: ARMED_GROUND → TAKEOFF" "Transition: TAKEOFF → FLYING"
order "Transition: TAKEOFF → FLYING" "in FLYING/POS_HOLD → LANDING"
order "in FLYING/POS_HOLD → LANDING" "Blind landing: ToF silent"
order "Blind landing: ToF silent" "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
order "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND" "ARM rejected: downward ToF is silent"
# Truth peak: measured 1.23 m (noise n2, seed 1; the three seeds of the acceptance run: 1.11, 1.16, 1.23 m) (main as of 2026-11-08, noise n2, seed 1: 4.6 m). Bound 1.5 m.
# 真値の最高: measured 1.23 m (noise n2, seed 1; the three seeds of the acceptance run: 1.11, 1.16, 1.23 m)（main（2026-11-08 時点）、ノイズ n2、seed 1: 4.6 m）。上限 1.5 m。
metric alt_max < 1.5 in 7.5 21.0
# Touchdown speed (truth): measured 1.99 m/s. Bound 2.4 m/s. The thrust of the descent without a ToF is at most 0.95 x the support thrust
# (it cannot climb whatever the velocity estimate says), so once the velocity target is reached the descent speed is set by that ceiling (0.05 g), not by the PI.
# 接地速度（真値）: 実測 1.99 m/s。上限 2.4 m/s。ToF なしの降下の推力は高々 支持推力の 0.95 倍（速度推定が何であれ上昇できない）で、
# 速度の目標に達した後の降下速度は PI でなくその上限（0.05 g）で決まる。
metric descent_speed_max < 2.4 in 8.4 15.0
# Landed and stays on the floor after the motors stop.
# モータ停止後は床の上で静止。
metric alt_max < 0.05 in 15.0 21.0
